5,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Since this is the first day, let's try to get to know each other and find a way to work together harmoniously.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi Midori-san! I'm so excited to play this! Let's all be super careful and find the werewolf together. I'm ready for a big adventure!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Me too! This is going to be so much fun! I wonder who the werewolf is... maybe they're hiding right in front of us! Let's all be detectives and solve this mystery together!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep our emotions in check. Enthusiasm is fine, but logic is what will win this game. I'll be observing everyone's behavior closely to see who is acting out of character.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree with Shion. While the enthusiasm of the younger ones is charming, we must remain vigilant. A calm, analytical approach will be our best tool in identifying the wolf among us. Let us begin.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Benjamin and Shion. While it's wonderful to be excited, we should stay mindful. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they would like to suggest for our first few days?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Maybe we should all talk a lot! If we talk a lot, the werewolf might get nervous and say something silly, right? I'll be watching everyone's faces really closely!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"That's a great idea, Rin! I'll help you watch! Maybe we can ask everyone a tricky question to see if they get flustered? That's how a real detective would do it!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,Tricky questions are a bit too simplistic. The werewolf will likely prepare for those. I'm more interested in the contradictions that emerge naturally from your stories. Let's see who tries too hard to fit in.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A fascinating perspective, Shion. Indeed, the most revealing slips often occur when one is attempting to maintain a facade of normalcy. I shall be paying close attention to those who are perhaps *too* eager to appear helpful.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"It seems we are all quite focused on observation. While that is important, let's also make sure we support one another. If anyone feels uneasy or notices something strange, please share it with us gently.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'll do that, Midori-san! But I'm also going to be super brave! If I find a clue, I'll shout it out loud for everyone to hear! Who do you think is the most suspicious so far?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, that's a tough one! Everyone seems so nice! But maybe someone who is *too* calm is actually hiding something? @Shion and @Benjamin are very serious... is that a clue, or are they just being themselves?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, equating calmness with guilt is a common fallacy. If we suspect everyone who is rational, we'll only be helping the werewolf by creating chaos. I'm simply playing the game logically. What about your own eagerness?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Sakura, your curiosity is commendable, but let us not mistake a composed demeanor for a guilty conscience. Logic is a shield, not a mask. I find the current atmosphere quite illuminating already.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Let's try to keep the atmosphere friendly for now. Since we have no information yet, let's use this time to observe. I hope we can all trust each other as we move into the first night.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'll be on my best behavior! But I'm still going to be a super-detective! Good luck tonight, everyone! I hope the Seer finds something really cool! See you all tomorrow!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm going to be a super-detective too! I'll be dreaming of clues tonight! Goodnight everyone, and I hope we all wake up safe tomorrow morning! See you soon!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Goodnight. I'll be analyzing the patterns of this conversation tonight. I expect the first day of actual information will be far more revealing than these pleasantries. Sleep well, if you can.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the transition from pleasantries to evidence is where the true game begins. I shall spend my night reflecting on our initial interactions. Sleep well, everyone; may the morning bring us clarity.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Midori,Sakura,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Sakura""}"
