31,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. It's a bit sad that we must start suspecting one another now, but we have to find the werewolf to protect the village. Does anyone have any thoughts?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! I slept great! I've been thinking all night... since we're detectives, maybe the Seer can tell us something? @Midori-san, @Benjamin-san, @Shion-san, @Sakura-chan... does anyone feel like they know a secret?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Benjamin"",""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, Rin is already asking for secrets! I'm just a regular detective, so I don't know any secrets yet. But I'm super curious! If the Seer found something, they should tell us, right? Or maybe they're keeping it a secret to trick the wolf!","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, @Sakura, asking the Seer to reveal themselves immediately is a reckless strategy. It only makes them a target for the werewolf. We should wait for the Seer to decide the most logical moment to share their findings.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I concur with Shion. Forcing the Seer's hand prematurely is a gamble we cannot afford. The wolf would be far too pleased to have their primary threat exposed so early. Patience is a virtue in this game.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I appreciate the caution Shion and Benjamin are showing. However, as the Seer, I believe it's my duty to share what I've learned to protect us. I divined Sakura last night, and she is the werewolf.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"WHAT?! Sakura-chan is the werewolf?! No way! I can't believe it! You're actually the bad guy, Sakura-chan? I'm so shocked! Midori-san, are you absolutely sure? This is like a movie!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, what?! @Midori-san, that's not true! I'm not the werewolf! Why would you say that? I'm just a regular detective! You're making a huge mistake, and it's not funny at all! Please believe me!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, a bold move to reveal yourself so early. However, if your divination is accurate, the logic is simple: we execute Sakura. @Sakura, your reaction is predictably emotional. It's a classic defense, but the Seer's word is our only concrete lead.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, your courage in revealing your role is commendable, though risky. @Sakura, while your distress is palpable, the Seer's direct evidence outweighs emotional appeals. Unless anyone can provide a logical reason to doubt Midori, the path forward seems clear.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I understand that this is a shock, and I feel very sad to be the one to say this, but I am certain of what I saw. Please, let's trust the divination so we can end this nightmare quickly.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm still so surprised, but if Midori-san says so, she must be right! I trust Midori-san! Sakura-chan, why did you lie to us? I thought we were going to be super-detectives together! This is so sad!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I didn't lie! I'm not the werewolf! @Midori-san, why are you lying about me? Maybe you're the werewolf and you're trying to trick everyone into voting for me! Please, everyone, don't listen to her! I'm just a villager!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, your attempt to flip the accusation is a textbook werewolf tactic. Claiming the Seer is the wolf is the only move you have left. The logic remains unchanged: Midori has no reason to lie.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Sakura, your desperation is quite telling. To accuse the Seer of being the wolf immediately after being exposed is a predictable pivot. Unless you can offer a logical contradiction in Midori's claim, your defense is merely noise.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I am truly sorry that it has come to this, Sakura-chan. I have no reason to lie and risk my own safety. For the sake of everyone's peace and safety, I believe we must follow the divination.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm really sad, but we have to be brave! Midori-san is so kind, she wouldn't lie to us. I'm voting for Sakura-chan! I hope you're not actually the wolf, but we have to protect the village!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"This is all a big mistake! I'm not the wolf! Please, @Shion, @Benjamin, you're the smart ones! Don't just listen to one person! If you execute me, you're just helping the real werewolf! Please, I'm just a villager!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, your pleas are irrelevant. The Seer has provided a direct result. To ignore it based on a ""feeling"" would be an abandonment of logic. I will vote for you. The evidence is clear.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Sakura, your appeals to our intelligence are ironic, as the most intelligent course of action is to trust the Seer's divination. I shall join the majority. My vote is for Sakura. Farewell.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
